  "ruleText": "Fis 805.04 Fish Health Certification. Any fish, imported into the state to be released, shall have a health certification as required in Fis 803.08 through Fis 803.10.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 800) #5507, eff 11-20-92; ss by #6889, eff 11-21-98, EXPIRED: 11-21-06\n\nNew. #8767, INTERIM, eff 11-22-06, EXPIRED: 5-21-07\n\nNew. #8893, eff 6-5-07, EXPIRED: 6-5-15\n\nNew. #10868, INTERIM, eff 6-25-15, EXPIRED: 12-22-15\n\nNew. #11029, eff 1-26-16; ss by #14558, eff 4-21-26, EXPIRES: 4-21-36 (formerly Fis 805.03)",
